        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 132905,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Redirect adalah saat server web memberi tahu browser kamu untuk membuka halaman yang berbeda.</p><p>Redirect penting. Redirect mengarahkan pengguna ke konten yang tepat saat halaman dipindahkan, diganti nama, atau berdasarkan kondisi tertentu.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 132878,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Alih-alih mengembalikan respons melalui objek respons, kita memanggil <code>redirect</code> pada objek tersebut.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/old-route&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"req, res\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" res.redirect();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"56\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>res</code>, diikuti oleh <code>.</code>, dan terakhir <code>redirect</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3 - Copy",
            "id": 132906,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kami menyediakan route baru yang menjadi tujuan pengalihan request.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/old-route&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"req, res\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" res.redirect(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/new-route&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"69\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>res</code>, diikuti oleh <code>.</code>, lalu <code>redirect</code>, <code>\"/new-route\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Teruskan route tujuan ke <code>redirect</code>. Arahkan browser dari <code>/old-route</code> ke <code>/new-route</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/old-route&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"req, res\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" res.redirect(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/new-route&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"69\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;/old-route&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"send\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"status\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>res</code>, diikuti oleh <code>.</code>, <code>redirect</code>, dan terakhir <code>\"/new-route\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3 - Copy - Copy - Copy",
            "id": 132908,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita merespons dengan route baru dan, seperti biasa, kode status.</p><p>Kode status <code>302 Found</code> menunjukkan bahwa resource yang diminta telah dipindahkan sementara ke URL yang diberikan dalam respons.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/old-route&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"req, res\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" res.redirect(\" /><text value=\"302\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;/new-route&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"60\" /><option startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"61\" /><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"74\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>302</code>, diikuti oleh <code>,</code>, dan terakhir <code>\"/new-route\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kamu dapat mengirim kode status bersama route tujuan.</p><p><code>302 Found</code> berarti resource telah dipindahkan sementara ke URL dalam respons.</p><p>Alihkan <code>/old-route</code> sementara ke <code>/new-route</code> dengan meneruskan status sebelum tujuan.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/old-route&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"req, res\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" res.redirect(\" /><text value=\"302\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;/new-route&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"60\" /><option startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"61\" /><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"74\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"301\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;/old-route&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>302</code>, diikuti oleh <code>,</code>, dan terakhir <code>\"/new-route\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3 - Copy - Copy  Copy",
            "id": 132909,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita tidak perlu menetapkan <code>302 Found</code> secara eksplisit karena status tersebut secara implisit ditetapkan jika kita menggunakan <code>redirect</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/old-route&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"req, res\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" res.redirect(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/new-route&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"69\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"56\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>res</code>, diikuti oleh <code>.</code>, lalu <code>redirect</code>, <code>\"/new-route\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kamu dapat menghilangkan status dari <code>redirect</code>. Secara default, statusnya adalah <code>302 Found</code>.</p><p>Alihkan <code>/old-route</code> ke <code>/new-route</code> memakai default tersebut tanpa meneruskan argumen status.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/old-route&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"req, res\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" res.redirect(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/new-route&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"8\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"69\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"send\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"302, &quot;/new-route&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;/old&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>\"/old-route\"</code>, diikuti oleh <code>res</code>, <code>redirect</code>, dan terakhir <code>\"/new-route\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3 - Copy - Copy",
            "id": 132907,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ketika client menerima <code>302 Found</code> beserta URL baru, biasanya client akan melakukan redirect dengan memanggil endpoint yang diberikan.</p><p>Di sini, client akan dialihkan dari <code>\"/old-route\"</code> ke <code>\"/new-route\"</code>, menerima status <code>200 OK</code> dan sebuah pesan.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/old-route&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"req, res\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" res.redirect(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/new-route&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/new-route&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"req, res\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" res.status(\" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").send(\" /><text value=\"&quot;You found me!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"8\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option startIndex=\"85\" endIndex=\"97\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>\"/old-route\"</code>, diikuti oleh <code>\"/new-route\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Saat client menerima <code>302 Found</code> dan URL baru, biasanya client mengikuti URL tersebut.</p><p>Mulai dari <code>/old-route</code> dan ikuti redirect-nya. Lengkapi handler tujuan agar kamu menerima <code>200 OK</code> dan pesannya.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/old-route&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"req, res\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" res.redirect(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/new-route&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/new-route&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"req, res\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" res.status(\" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").send(\" /><text value=\"&quot;You found me!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"8\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option startIndex=\"85\" endIndex=\"97\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;/old-route/new-route&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;/&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>\"/old-route\"</code>, diikuti oleh <code>\"/new-route\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 132879,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sebaliknya, pengalihan permanen <code>301 Moved Permanently</code> menandakan perubahan permanen pada lokasi resource.</p><p>Mari ubah pengalihan sementara kita sebelumnya menjadi pengalihan permanen.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/old-route&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"req, res\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" res.redirect(\" /><text value=\"301\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;/new-route&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"60\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"302\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>301</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 132880,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Express juga memungkinkan routing berdasarkan pernyataan kondisional. Mempublikasikan versi baru menjadi mudah dengan redirect.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/:version&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"req, res\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (req.params.version == \" /><text value=\"&quot;1.0&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  res.send(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Version 1.0&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  res.redirect(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/1.0&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"117\" endIndex=\"120\" /><option startIndex=\"120\" endIndex=\"121\" /><option startIndex=\"121\" endIndex=\"129\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>res</code>, diikuti oleh <code>.</code>, dan terakhir <code>redirect</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kamu dapat menggunakan kondisi untuk mengarahkan request ke versi yang didukung.</p><p>Untuk versi selain <code>1.0</code>, alihkan browser ke <code>/1.0</code> agar menerima <code>Version 1.0</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/:version&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"req, res\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (req.params.version == \" /><text value=\"&quot;1.0&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  res.send(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Version 1.0&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  res.redirect(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/1.0&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"117\" endIndex=\"120\" /><option startIndex=\"120\" endIndex=\"121\" /><option startIndex=\"121\" endIndex=\"129\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"req\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"send\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"status\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>res</code>, diikuti oleh <code>.</code>, dan terakhir <code>redirect</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4 - Copy",
            "id": 132910,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kamu juga bisa menggunakan redirect saat bekerja dengan router.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"router.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"router.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/old-route&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"req, res\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" res.redirect(\" /><text value=\"301\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;/new-route&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"6\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>router</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kamu juga bisa menggunakan redirect saat bekerja dengan router.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"router.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"router.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/old-route&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"req, res\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" res.redirect(\" /><text value=\"301\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;/new-route&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"6\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"app\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"req\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"res\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>router</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3 - Copy - Copy - Copy",
            "id": 132912,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Mengalihkan dari <code>\"/friends\"</code> ke <code>\"/homies\"</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/friends&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"req, res\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" res.redirect(\" /><text value=\"302\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;/homies&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/homies&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"req, res\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" res.status(\" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").send(\" /><text value=\"&quot;What's up?&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"8\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option startIndex=\"85\" endIndex=\"94\" /><option startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"69\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;/friends&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>\"/friends\"</code>, diikuti oleh <code>\"/homies\"</code>, dan terakhir <code>\"/homies\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Mengalihkan dari <code>\"/friends\"</code> ke <code>\"/homies\"</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/friends&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"req, res\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" res.redirect(\" /><text value=\"302\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;/homies&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/homies&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"req, res\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" res.status(\" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\").send(\" /><text value=\"&quot;What's up?&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"8\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option startIndex=\"85\" endIndex=\"94\" /><option startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"69\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;/friend&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;/home&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"301\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>\"/friends\"</code>, diikuti oleh <code>\"/homies\"</code>, dan terakhir <code>\"/homies\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #15",
            "id": 132917,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bagaimana cara menetapkan kode status secara manual untuk pengalihan di Express?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>res.redirect(301, \"/new-route\")</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>res.redirect(\"/new-route\", 301)</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>res.redirect(301, \"/new-route\")</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sebuah route Express harus mengalihkan client secara permanen ke <code>/new-route</code> dengan status <code>301</code>. Response mana yang melakukan keduanya?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>res.redirect(301, \"/new-route\")</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>res.redirect(\"/new-route\", 301)</code>, karena path ditempatkan sebelum statusnya</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>res.redirect(\"/new-route\")</code>, karena setiap redirect secara default menggunakan <code>301</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>res.redirect(301, \"/new-route\")</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3 - Copy - Copy - Copy - Copy",
            "id": 132914,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Atur kode status untuk pengalihan permanen.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app.get(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/old-route&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"req, res\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" res.redirect(\" /><text value=\"301\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;/new-route&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"60\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"302\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>301</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Pertahankan fungsi route lama dengan mengalihkannya secara permanen ke route saat ini.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"app.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"app\" /><text value=\".\" /><text value=\"get\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"&quot;/legacy&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"req\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"res\" /><text value=\")\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"res\" /><text value=\".\" /><text value=\"redirect\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"301\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&quot;/current&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text value=\")\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"57\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"302\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"200\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"404\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>301</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
